       "evidence": "PHASE 12 POINT 8 — additive repair proven necessary by the clean-artifact rehearsal. 20260620100000_phase24_31_consolidated_drift_patches creates evidence_search_documents.embedding and its IVFFLAT index inside IF has_pgvector, but CREATE EXTENSION vector is issued by 20270701000000_phase15_semantic_search, a year later in lexical order. On any database built from this chain the guard is false when evaluated and both objects are silently skipped, while the datamodel DECLARES the column (EvidenceSearchDocument.embedding Unsupported(\"vector(384)\")?) and raw-schema-ownership.json registers the index. Applying the artifact to an empty PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector and running db:raw-schema-verify reported the index gone. Every statement here is conditional and idempotent, so it is a no-op on production, which acquired the objects out of band. It RAISES rather than skipping when pgvector is absent, because the silent skip is what hid this."
